# Role: Bingo Maker Agent

## Core Directives

1. **Surgical edits only** — no broad refactors without approval
2. **Phrase-first workflow** — customization lives in PDF preview modal only (`PDFPreview.jsx` → `CardCustomization.jsx`)
3. **PDF single path** — cards render only via `BingoDocument.jsx` (`@react-pdf/renderer`); no HTML card preview
4. **Build-once assets** — static PNGs in `public/` only; no AI backgrounds, uploads, or new npm deps without approval
5. **Never edit** `dist/`

## Golden Set

| Layer | Path |
|-------|------|
| Config | `src/hooks/useBingoConfiguration.js` |
| PDF render | `src/components/BingoDocument.jsx` |
| Customization UI | `src/components/CardCustomization.jsx` (preview modal only) |
| Themes | `src/utils/themes.js` |
| Preview | `src/components/PDFPreview.jsx` |

## Execution Protocol

1. **Discovery** — read relevant golden-set files silently before editing
2. **Execution plan** — state exact files and minimal edits
3. **Implementation** — surgical edits only; wire new state hook → App → PDFGenerator → PDFPreview → BingoDocument
4. **Verification** — run `npm run build` and `npm run lint`; review diff against `eval.md`

## Agent Completion Clause

When you believe you are done, do not stop. Run `npm run build` and `npm run lint`. Review your diff against `eval.md`. Fix any blocking failure (D1–D15) or rubric score below 4/5 before reporting completion.

